{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國國民醫療服務體系於11月16日發佈健康提示，借《GTA6》即將上市提醒玩家保護雙手，避免長時間操作帶來的重複性勞損。其首要建議是定時離開遊戲椅或沙發休息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:10:00.192940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_hash":"beb1ec5bb7b7e4391141dd4f51bca5b67eefcd9e8f16122b7f3156d69032fe42","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}